# More info: https://docs.docker.com/engine/reference/builder/#dockerignore-file
#
# Deliberately a plain denylist. The previous ignore-all-then-re-include form
# broke under buildah/podman, where a file cannot be re-included beneath an
# excluded directory: nested Go sources were silently dropped and builds failed
# with "package cmd/main.go is not in std". Explicit and boring works everywhere.

# Build-irrelevant trees (bin/ alone is ~139MB of local tool binaries).
.git
.github
.devcontainer
bin
dist

# Tests never build inside the images.
**/*_test.go
